"The Premium eStore is designed for businesses that want to sell online at "
"scale. It supports larger product catalogs, more categories, and advanced "
"shop features. You get more control over how products are displayed and "
"managed, so the store feels professional and reliable. It is ideal when "
"online sales are an important part of your business, not just an add-on."
